        <footnote id="F1">Ms. Milz was awarded 48,698 shares of restricted stock, one-quarter of which vested on the grant date, September 21, 2026, and the remainder of which vest in equal annual installments on September 20th of each year until September 20, 2029, contingent on continued employment by Great Elm Group, Inc.</footnote>
